ok   text escapes & < > and leaves the quotes
ok   an attribute value escapes all five
ok   raw writes its bytes unescaped
ok   text with nothing to escape is unchanged
ok   three deep
ok   siblings in one block, in order
ok   attr and flag are the escape hatches
ok   el and elVoidA reach a tag outside the table
ok   void elements close nothing
ok   for binds the caller's name over three items
ok   for over an empty vector writes nothing
ok   forInt over Ints
ok   a caller's i and n survive the loop template
ok   a component is a function taking the builder
ok   when, taken
ok   when, not taken
ok   a document built once is its hand-written bytes
